# Recommended yt-dlp options for SinusBot (copy to data/yt-dlp.conf).
#
# Why not "-f 18" / "-f 18/best"?
#   Format 18 (progressive mp4 360p) is rarely offered anymore. Requesting it
#   makes yt-dlp exit 1 → SinusBot skips every track in a "playlist storm".
# Prefer low-bitrate audio; fall back to any bestaudio, then best progressive
# (best* avoids needing ffmpeg to merge bestvideo+bestaudio).
-f ba[abr<=128]/bestaudio/best*
--no-part
--socket-timeout 30
--retries 5

# Optional: if YouTube rate-limits your VPS IP, add a proxy here, e.g.:
# --proxy http://127.0.0.1:7890
